<title>FINLAND: TAMFELT SEES 1996 RESULT UP ON 1995.</title>
<headline>TAMFELT SEES 1996 RESULT UP ON 1995.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forming fabrics manufacturer Tamfelt Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it expects its full-year 1996 result to improve on 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;The result for the year 1996 will improve on the previous year,&quot; Tamfelt said.</p>
<p>In 1995, Tamfelt had a 76.3 million markka profit before extraordinary items, appropriations and taxes.</p>
